1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,577
Shifokor kuniga ikki soatini yozuvga sarflaydi.

2
00:00:03,527 --> 00:00:10,555
Med.uz.ai’da shikoyatni yozasiz — sun’iy intellekt qaydning qoralamasini va MKB o‘n tashxis takliflarini beradi.

3
00:00:10,555 --> 00:00:13,727
Siz tekshirasiz, bir bosishda imzolaysiz.

4
00:00:13,727 --> 00:00:16,097
Qaror hamisha shifokorniki.

5
00:00:16,097 --> 00:00:18,822
Shifokorga vaqt, bemorga e’tibor.

6
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:21,298
Bepul demo — med.uz.ai.

